<machine_speech><gray>Battle log — outcome: <shining>{result}<\shining>. Duration {ticks} ticks. Own losses {lost}. Enemy destroyed {killed}. Fleet strength {ships}.<\gray>
?if result = victory
<gray>The strike hit the bait and broke on the fortress. A garrison is a claim about the future; the adversary believed it.<\gray>
?else
<gray>The bait was real to it and the fortress did not hold. Check the strike size against the fortress garrison.<\gray>
?end
?if notes ~ bait
<gray>[ Cross-reference: the operator's notes mention bait. ]<\gray>
?end
